OL,3,GNEWSAMan who murdered Orkney waiter to
OL,4,Ahave conviction reviewed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former soldier serving a life
OL,7,Fsentence for the murder of a waiter in
OL,8,FOrkney in 1994 is to have his
OL,9,Fconviction re-examined.
OL,11,FShamsuddin Mahmood, 26, was shot in the
OL,12,Fhead at point-blank range as he served
OL,13,Fcustomers in an Indian restaurant in
OL,14,FKirkwall.
OL,16,FMichael Ross - who was just 15 at the
OL,17,Ftime - was convicted in 2008 after he
OL,18,Fjoined the Army and became a sniper. He
OL,19,Fhas always maintained his innocence.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
