OL,3,GNEWSAMan who murdered Orkney waiter to
OL,4,Ahave conviction reviewed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA previous bid by Ross to have the case
OL,7,Freviewed by the Scottish Criminal Cases
OL,8,FReview Commission (SCCRC) was rejected
OL,9,Fin 2014.
